\**{c=red:Note:}** You can only partake on one quest of this questline per Earth day. Other quests that are affected by this restriction are {q:Scouting the Ashu Talif|Scouting the Ashu Talif|Scouting the Ashu Talif} and {q:Royal Painter Escort|Royal Painter Escort|Royal Painter Escort}.
=2 Walkthrough
* Trade {n:Halshaob} one {@i:Imp. Mtl. Piece|2186} {i:Imperial Mythril Piece|Imperial Mythril Piece|2186}.
** You are only allowed to do this quest once every 24 hours.
* Head to the Cutter, located in the {z:Arrapago Reef}.
** To get there, first travel to {z:Dvucca Isle Staging Point} and exit into the Mire.
** Head East to (G-9) and zone into {z:Arrapago Reef}.
** Head North to (H-8) to find the Cutter.
** The Survival Guide in Caedarva Mire puts you on the north side of the zone, which is a short run to G-8.
** The {i:Arrapago Ring|Arrapago Ring|26235}, purchased with 100 {p:Imperial standing accolades}, will teleport you in front of the Cutter.
* The battle has a 30 minute time limit.
* Make your way to the cabin of the ship. Along the way you will run into 2 {m:Windjammer Imps|Windjammer Imp}.
** They are great for building {p:TP} for the NM fight ahead.
* Inside the cabin you will find 2 NM's: {m:Cutthroat Kabsalah} and his pet {m:Bubbly}.
** {m:Cutthroat Kabsalah} is a {p:COR} and has access to {p:Wild Card}.
*** He will always use a {p:Weapon Skill} immediately after using {p:Wild Card}.
** {m:Cutthroat Kabsalah} double attacks almost every time.
** {m:Bubbly} is an Opo-opo and has access to all their regular {p:TP} moves.
*** His **Spinning Claw** is a very powerful AoE move.
* At the end of the fight, you can get up to three treasure chests. The conditions for these to appear are as follows:
* 1): Defeat {m:Cutthroat Kabsalah}
* 2): Defeat {m:Cutthroat Kabsalah} after defeating {m:Bubbly}
* 3): Attack {m:Cutthroat Kabsalah} by surprising him. In order to do this, the following conditions must be met:
** The {m:Windjammer Imps|Windjammer Imp} must be attacked, not aggroed
** {m:Cutthroat Kabsalah} must not hear any of the flute-based abilities of the Imps
** {m:Cutthroat Kabsalah} must be pulled (preferably by spells or ranged attacks) without alarming {m:Bubbly}
** If you successfully surprise the captain, he will say something indicating his surprise.
* The ideal strategy is to have someone kite {m:Cutthroat Kabsalah} while the rest of the party focuses on killing {m:Bubbly}.
* Once {m:Bubbly} is down, everyone can take out {m:Cutthroat Kabsalah}.
* After both NM's are defeated, treasure chests will spawn on the boat.

=3 Notes:
* {@i:Barb. Zerehs|15617} {i:Barbarossa's Zerehs|Barbarossa's Zerehs|15617} can be found in either of the first two chests.
* The third chest contains {i:??? Gloves|??? Gloves|2195} which sometimes appraise into {@i:Barb. Moufles|14943} {i:Barbarossa's Moufles|Barbarossa's Moufles|14943}.

